  "narrative": {
    "benchmark_md": "Four peers were selected and locked during the research phase based on geographic overlap, asset size, and strategic trajectory. Peer technology stacks were validated through Explorium Vibe Prospecting technographics enrichment, providing machine-verified tech stack data rather than estimates. Peer scores at the category level were computed from publicly observable evidence and Explorium-validated technology deployments. The peer median serves as the primary benchmark for gap analysis and priority scoring.",
    "issue_register_md": "This section is borrowed from the Client Profile Research Report (Section 5.1) with assessment scoring impacts added. Three issues were identified during public evidence research. None rise to CRITICAL severity. STCU maintains a clean regulatory record with no NCUA enforcement actions, no data breaches, and no litigation [E-035, E-098].",
    "per_pillar_md": {
      "P1": "STCU's positioning against peers reveals a clear pattern: infrastructure security leadership paired with member experience underinvestment (P2). This asymmetry creates both a competitive vulnerability (peers are investing in member-facing platforms STCU lacks) and a strategic opportunity (the security foundation de-risks accelerated digital transformation).",
